OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,
OL,6,Fthundery showers fading inland during
OL,7,Fthe evening, then becoming largely dry
OL,8,Fovernight with clear spells. Staying
OL,9,Fbreezy along the coast with isolated
OL,10,Fshowers continuing. A notably cooler
OL,11,Fnight than of late.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FOutbreaks of rain spreading
OL,14,Fsouthwards through the day, but less
OL,15,Fintense than on Thursday. Temperatures
OL,16,Fbelow the seasonal average and the
OL,17,Fcool breeze continues.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
